# Security and GDPR

- Levels: **PERSONAL** (lowest, home/vibe) · **OFFICIAL** · **SECRET** (highest). Isolated credentials, browser profiles, plans, settings scopes — never mix.
- **BYOK cloud LLM keys** (Grok/xAI, OpenAI, Anthropic, OpenRouter, OpenAI-compatible): **PERSONAL only**. Refuse on OFFICIAL and SECRET.
- Ollama remains the default agent runtime on all levels.
- No telemetry by default. Explicit consent before storing extracted document data. First cloud agent outbound on PERSONAL needs confirm (or sticky level consent).
- Easy local data deletion is a product requirement.
- Confirm with the human before changing security-level handling further.
- Manual invoke: `@security-levels` when working on isolation or LLM routing.
